## Why an image could not be added to a note.

# $reason is a sentence explaining why.
errors-image-add = Couldn't add the image. { $reason }
errors-image-unreadable = The image is damaged or in a format Notein can't read.
errors-image-too-large = The image is too large. Try a smaller one.
errors-image-unsupported = This kind of image link isn't supported.
